            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ɛ jɛn cua̱ naath ja̱k ni däärdɔaar Kɛ-dhe-moth ja̱kä kɛ Thi-yon kuäär Ɛc-bon kɛ kui̱ malä jiökä jɛ i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Jak ni ɣä kä wä kɛ rɛy wecdu. Bä luk ni duɔ̱ɔ̱p kä rɔa, cä bi ciɛc gekä cuëëc kiɛ caam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bä mi̱eth in bä cam kɛnɛ pi̱ tin bä math kɔk kɛ yio̱w. Jakni ɣä kä wä kɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱p, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ce̱tnikɛ mëë ci gaat E-thɔ tin cieŋ kä The-ir kɛnɛ ji̱ Mo-ab tin cieŋ kä Ar ɛ lät kä ɣä, mäni mi cä wä kui̱c Yieer Jɔr-dɛn muun in ci Kuoth Nhial Kuothda jɛ ka̱m kɔ.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
