        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Duundɛ ɣöö /ken Thi-yon kuäär Ɛc-bon ɛ nhök nɛy i̱ ba̱kɔ kɛ wecdɛ. Kɛ ɣöö ci Kuoth Nhial Kuothdun locdɛ jak kä bum, kɛ ɣöö bɛ jɛ ka̱m yɛ, ce̱tkɛ mi cɛ la̱t ɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä cu Kuoth Nhial ɣä jiök i̱, ‘Nɛnɛ, cä tok kɛ mi ka̱mä ji̱ Thi-yon kɛ mundɛ. Ɛn täämɛ wër ko̱o̱r bi wec wä ka̱n.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Thi-yon ben kä kɔ kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ diaal, cua̱kɔ ben nyiëëny kä yaadh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial Kuothda jɛ ka̱m kɔ. Cua̱kɔ jɛ joc kɛnɛ gaatkɛ kɛ nɛɛkɛ diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua̱kɔ wi̱i̱kɛ diaal käp ɛn cäŋ ëë kä cua̱kɔ wi̱i̱ diaal da̱k ni piny, wutni, kɛ män, kɛ gaat, thilɛ mi cuakɔ päl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ ni ɣɔ̱k kä rɔ kɛn tëë cua̱kɔ ka̱n ala nyinkɔ, kɛnɛ kuak wi̱i̱ni tëë cakɔ käp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A känɛ ni kä Ä-ro-er awä lo̱o̱lä Ar-non, a lɛnɛ ka̱n ni wi̱c in te wi̱i̱ lo̱o̱lä aräth ni kä Gil-yad, thilɛ wec mi cu buɔ̱m kä kɔ. Kɛ ɣöö ci Kuoth Nhial Kuothda kɛ ka̱m kɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu thil ni wi̱i̱ ji̱ Am-on kɛnɛ tin te jɔk kiɛɛr Ya-bɔk kɛ wi̱i̱ päämni, kɛ gua̱th diaal tëë ci Kuoth Nhial Kuothdan kɔn gok i̱ /canɛ bi wä thi̱n.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
